<title>INDIA: CRICKET-KARNATAKA 87 FOR 4 V SOUTH AFRICA (243) AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-KARNATAKA 87 FOR 4 V SOUTH AFRICA (243) AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Ranji Trophy</p>
<p>champions Karnataka were 87 for four at close of play on the</p>
<p>first day of the three-day game against South Africa on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 243; Karnataka 87-4.</p>
</text>
